            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A computer-readable storage medium storing an application program which causes an information processing apparatus to perform a control method, the application program cooperating with a general-purpose driver, the general-purpose driver being capable of outputting a print instruction to an image forming apparatus by communication using an Internet Printing Protocol (IPP), the control method including causing the information processing apparatus to display an object for receiving a setting related to shortening a job name from a user, the application program enabling the information processing apparatus to display the object.</p>
